
---
import '../../styles/global.css';
---

<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <title>CPA Requirements | Hunter College Accounting Society</title>
  </head>
  <body class="bg-[#0e0716] text-neutral-100 min-h-screen font-sans antialiased">
    
    <!-- Top Bar Navigation -->
    <header class="border-b border-[#5F259F]/30 bg-[#0e0716]/90 px-6 py-4">
      <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto flex items-center justify-between">
        <a href="/" class="text-sm font-bold text-white hover:text-[#FFC72A] transition flex items-center gap-2">
          <span>← Back to Home</span>
        </a>
        <span class="text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-[#FFC72A] font-semibold">Education Guide</span>
      </div>
    </header>

    <!-- Main Content -->
    <main class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 py-12 space-y-8">
      <div>
        <span class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-[#FFC72A] bg-[#5F259F]/30 border border-[#FFC72A]/40 px-3 py-1 rounded-full">
          New York State Licensure
        </span>
        <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-extrabold text-white mt-4">CPA Exam & Licensure Requirements</h1>
        <p class="text-neutral-300 mt-2 text-base">
          An overview of the 120-credit exam sit requirements and the 150-credit licensure pathway in New York.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Information Cards -->
      <div class="space-y-6">
        <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-[#190e2b]/60 border border-[#5F259F]/30 space-y-3">
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-white">To Sit for the Uniform CPA Exam (120 Credits)</h2>
          <ul class="list-disc list-inside text-sm text-neutral-300 space-y-2">
            <li>120 semester hours of college-level education.</li>
            <li>Financial Accounting & Reporting coursework (upper-level).</li>
            <li>Cost / Managerial Accounting.</li>
            <li>Taxation course coverage.</li>
            <li>Audit and Attestation course.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-[#190e2b]/60 border border-[#5F259F]/30 space-y-3">
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-white">For Full Licensure (150 Credits)</h2>
          <ul class="list-disc list-inside text-sm text-neutral-300 space-y-2">
            <li>Completion of 150 total semester hours.</li>
            <li>33 semester hours in accounting courses.</li>
            <li>36 semester hours in general business electives.</li>
            <li>One year of acceptable full-time accounting experience verified by an active CPA.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </main>

  </body>
</html>
